$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Acetophenone
(5-Nitro-4,6-diphenyl-2-pyrimidinyl)hydrazone (6a). A mixture of
hydrazino-pyrimidine 3 (0.43 g, 1.4 mmol) and acetophenone (0.20 g, 1.7
mmol) in methanol (10 ml) was boiled for 3 h. The precipitated solid was
filtered off, and washed with methanol. Hydrazone 6d. Yield: 98%.
Compounds were recrystallized from methanol. Empirical formula:
C23H17N5O2. Found: N, %: 17.69, M: 529.16443, Calculated: N, %: 17.71, M:
395.13858. mp, 191-193°C. IR spectrum, νNO2, cm-1: νas: 1546, 1525.9, νs:
1349.4, 1329, Mass spectrum (Irel, %): M+,12.7, [M-OH-NO]+: 1.
