$DATUM 2-(3,5-Dimethyl-1-pyrazolyl)-5-nitro-4,6-diphenylpyrimidine (4a). A
mixture of hydrazino-pyrimidine 3 (1.5 g, 4.9 mmol) and acetylacetone
(0.6 g, 6.0 mmol) in ethanol (7 ml) was boiled for 4 h. After cooling,
the solid was filtered off, washed with ethanol. Yield: (1.8 g), 96%.
Compounds were recrystallized from ethanol-dioxan mixture. Empirical
formula: C25H20N4O4. Found: N, %: 12.72, M: 440.14841, Calculated: N, %:
12.51, M: 440.14844. mp, 249-251°C. IR spectrum, νNO2, cm-1: νas: 1528.8,
νs: 1343.5, Mass spectrum (Irel, %): M+,100, [M-NO2]+: 6.1, [M-NO]+0.9,
[M-NO-CO]+: 1.4, [M-OH]+: 0.4, [M-OH-CO]+: (12.4), [M-OH-NO]+: 2.1.
