$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Acetophenone
(5-Nitro-4,6-diphenyl-2-pyrimidinyl)hydrazone (6a). A mixture of
hydrazino-pyrimidine 3 (0.43 g, 1.4 mmol) and acetophenone (0.20 g, 1.7
mmol) in methanol (10 ml) was boiled for 3 h. The precipitated solid was
filtered off, and washed with methanol. Hydrazone 6b, Yield: 96%.
Compounds were recrystallized from ethanol. Empirical formula:
C25H21N5O2. Found: N, %: 16.7, M: 409.15386, Calculated: N, %: 16.54, M:
423.16854. mp, 171-174°C. IR spectrum, νNO2, cm-1: νas: 1538.4, νs:
1335.3, Mass spectrum (Irel, %): M+,100, [M-NO2]+: 10.9, [M-NO]+0.7,
[M-NO-CO]+: 0.2, [M-OH]+: 2.7, [M-OH-CO]+: 2.8, [M-OH-NO]+: 12.2.
