$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Acetophenone
(5-Nitro-4,6-diphenyl-2-pyrimidinyl)hydrazone (6a). A mixture of
hydrazino-pyrimidine 3 (0.43 g, 1.4 mmol) and acetophenone (0.20 g, 1.7
mmol) in methanol (10 ml) was boiled for 3 h. The precipitated solid was
filtered off, and washed with methanol. Hydrazone 6c, Yield: 96%.
Compounds were recrystallized from ethanol-dioxan mixture. Empirical
formula: C32H27N5O3. Found: N, %: 13.12, M: 423.16951, Calculated: N, %:
13.23, M: 529.21045. mp, 162-164°C. IR spectrum, νNO2, cm-1: νas: 1537.2,
νs: 1334.3, Mass spectrum (Irel, %): M+,33.9, [M-NO2]+: 9.6, [M-NO]+2,
[M-OH]+: 2.5, [M-OH-CO]+: 5.3, [M-OH-NO]+: 3.2.
