$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Acetophenone
(5-Nitro-4,6-diphenyl-2-pyrimidinyl)hydrazone (6a). A mixture of
hydrazino-pyrimidine 3 (0.43 g, 1.4 mmol) and acetophenone (0.20 g, 1.7
mmol) in methanol (10 ml) was boiled for 3 h. The precipitated solid was
filtered off, and washed with methanol. Yield: (0.54 g), 94%. Compounds
were recrystallized from methanol. Empirical formula: C24H19N5O2. Found:
N, %: 17.15, M: 456.11821, Calculated: N, %: 17.11, M: 409.1538. mp,
163-167°C. IR spectrum, νNO2, cm-1: νas: 1536.3, νs: 1334.1, Mass
spectrum (Irel, %): M+,91.1, [M-NO2]+: 13.4, [M-NO]+ 0.7, [M-OH]+: 2.5,
[M-OH-CO]+: 3.1, [M-OH-NO]+: 19.2.
