$DATUM 3-Nitrobenzalhydrazide of
2,6-Dimethyl-5-(5-methylsulfanyl[1,3,4]oxadiazol-2-yl)nicotinic acid (4).
m-Nitrobenzaldehyde (0.27 g, 1.79 mmol) was added to a solution of
compound 3 (0.5 g, 1.79 mmol) in ethanol (25 ml). The reaction mixture
was boiled for 30 min, the precipitate was filtered off and crystallized
from DMF. Yield 0.66 g (90%). mp 196-197°C. 1H NMR spectrum, δ, ppm: 2.64
(3H, s, SCH3); 2.85 (6H, s, 2,6-CH3); 7.50-8.45 (5H, m, C6H4CH); 8.62
(1H, s, Py); 12.25 (1H, s, NH). Found, %: C 52.23; H 4.43; N 20.29.
C18H16N6O4S. Calculated, %: C 52.39; H 3.92; N 20.38.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
