$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2.3 Synthesis of
N-(6-chromon-3-ylmethyleneamino)-S-{[4-aryl-5-(pyrid-4-yl)]-1,2,4-triazol-2-yl}mercaptoacetamide
1 mmol
S-{[4-aryl-5-(pyrid-4-yl)]-1,2,4-triazol-3-yl}mercaptoacethydrazide
(3a-3e) was dissolved in 5 mL DMF followed by the addition of 1 mmol
3-formylchromone (4a-4d) and 1 mL glacial acetic acid. The reaction
mixture was magnetically stirred at room temperature for 6 h. The
solution turned turbid gradually. Until large amounts of precipitate
formed (If no precipitate, the reaction mixture was frozen in a
refrigerator), filtered and dried. The crude product was recrystallized
from DMF/EtOH/H2O. 7d, 84 %, yellowish solid m.p. 250-252 °C; 1H NMR δ:
3.82 (s, 3H, OCH3), 4.40 (s, 2H, SCH2), 7.13-7.22 (m, 7H, ArH and chromon
5,7,8-H), 7.25 (s, 1H, CH=N), 7.32 (d, J = 4.9 Hz, 2H, pyridine 3,5-H),
8.53 (d, J = 4.9 Hz, 2H, pyridine 2,6-H), 8.81 (s, 1H, chromon 2-H),
11.56 (s, 1H, NH); IR (KBr) νmax: 3220 (NH), 1680 (acylhydrazon C=O),
1617 (chromon C=O), 1606 (C=N), 1600-1400 (skeletal vibration of aromatic
ring) cm-1; MS m/z (%): 546 (M+, 7), 297 (10), 223 (16), 221 (50), 156
(32), 154 (100), 128 (16), 126 (50), 119 (5). Anal. calcd for
C26H19ClN6O4S: C 57.09, H 3.50, N 15.37; found C 56.98, H 3.46, N 15.21.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Mannich reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis of
N-[(chromonylmethylene)amino]-S-[[4-aryl-5-(pyridinyl)]-1,2,4-triazol-2-yl]mercaptoacetamide
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Cao, Ling-Hua; Yan, Ke
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Youji Huaxue (2007), 27(2), 255-260

